OL,3,GNEWSADad with terminal cancer
OL,4,Adetermined to walk daughter down aisle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire dad with incurable cancer
OL,7,Fhas said he is determined to walk down
OL,8,Fthe aisle with his daughter on her
OL,9,Fwedding day.
OL,11,FJason Walker, 57, of Longridge, was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed with blood cancer 12 years
OL,13,Fago after having symptoms of back pain
OL,14,Fand blurred vision. It has since spread
OL,15,Fand he has been told his illness is
OL,16,Fterminal.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1787468167
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADad with terminal cancer
OL,4,Adetermined to walk daughter down aisle
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter two stem cell transplants and
OL,7,Fmore than a decade of treatment, Jason
OL,8,Fhas begun a clinical trial at the
OL,9,FChristie hospital in Manchester in the
OL,10,Fhope he can fulfil his dream of walking
OL,11,Fhis daughter down the aisle at her
OL,12,Fwedding in Montenegro.
OL,14,F"Terminal cancer won't stop me, I want
OL,15,Fto be well enough to walk my beautiful
OL,16,Fdaughter down the aisle and give her
OL,17,Faway," he said.
